# Large or regenerable media. Kept in git: scripts, build code, narration text + mp3s,
# music, SFX, fonts, PNG illustrations (paid or slow to regenerate, all small).

# phone recordings, pulled PDFs (personal data) and their 30fps copies
assets/raw/
assets/cfr/

# outputs
**/renders/
**/snapshots/

# scene cuts the build regenerates from assets/cfr
*-film/assets/video/

# the vertical project's assets/ is a Windows junction to the landscape project's
*-film-vertical/assets

# intermediate music edit (music_film.mp3 is rebuilt from music_v2.mp3)
**/music_v2f.mp3

# the repo root ignores build/ — the film generators are source, keep them
!/*-film/build/
audio/admin/old/
